1.4 Decision Engine and Supervisor
The Decision Engine outputs BUY candidate, SELL candidate, WAIT, or REJECT. A candidate is a request for the EA to evaluate an entry. It is not an order. The Supervisor in the EA applies the full approval chain in V4 section 6, and may refuse any candidate. Backend and dashboard cannot disable the Supervisor.
